      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "prompt": "Review a fictional method summary. A source calls its own step fuzzy reinforcement: fuzzy c-means estimates cluster centers and a least-squares projection learns to approximate center-related feature targets. There is no reward, policy, action selection or environment interaction in the supplied implementation. The author draft calls this a reinforcement-learning module. Preserve the implemented operation and give a concise English replacement and a source-attribution note. Do not invent references or performance results.",
